sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Seller / SaaS
  participant G as Protected Gateway
  participant I as Invoice Service
  participant T as Taxpayer + Tax Rules
  participant D as Authoritative DB
  participant E as Event Bus
  participant R as Reconciliation / Returns
  participant N as ITAS / NamRA Adapter
  S->>G: Submit invoice + identity + idempotency key
  G->>G: Authenticate, authorize, bound, quota, correlate
  G->>I: Canonical command
  I->>T: Resolve parties, capabilities, rule and period
  T-->>I: Verified snapshots + rule version
  I->>D: Atomic invoice + VAT ledger + audit + outbox
  D-->>I: Durable IDs / receipt
  I-->>S: Certified transaction receipt
  D->>E: Relay outbox event
  E->>R: Match and assemble governed return state
  R->>N: Idempotent return/status integration
  N-->>R: Official receipt/status or controlled error
